---

🧩 PART 5: AUTO SELECT SECTION FROM LINK (ADVANCED)

If you send link like:

...?section=PR INK


---

In Screen1.OnVisible:

Set(
    varSectionName,
    Param("section")
);

Set(
    varSelectedSection,
    LookUp('SE Section List', Title = varSectionName)
);

Set(
    varHasAccess,
    CountRows(
        Filter(
            'SE Access List',
            Section.Id = varSelectedSection.ID &&
            User.Email = User().Email
        )
    ) > 0
)


---

Then:

Dropdown_Section.Default = varSelectedSection.Title


---

🧠 HOW IT WORKS

User opens app
   ↓
Selects section
   ↓
System checks:
   Is user in SE Access List?
      YES → allow
      NO  → block


---

